' agents-sandbox — Configuration precedence (later entries override earlier ones)
title agents-sandbox — Configuration precedence

start
:1. Built-in / flag defaults;
:2. User-level\n\~/.config/agents-sandbox/;
:3. User per-slug\n\~/.config/agents-sandbox/<slug>/;
:4. Project-level\n.agents-sandbox/;
:5. Legacy env vars\nOPENCODE_SANDBOX_* (deprecated);
:6. Environment variables\nAGENTS_SANDBOX_*;
:7. CLI flags;
stop
